<table class="licensetpl fileinfotpl fileinfotpl-type-fairuse nfur">
<caption><div><a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:Non-free_content" title="Wikipedia:Non-free content">Non-free</a> media information and <a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:Non-free_use_rationale_guideline" title="Wikipedia:Non-free use rationale guideline">use rationale</a>  <span class="licensetpl&#95;nonfree nfur-nonfree">true</span> for <a href="/wiki/Spider-Man_in_film" title="Spider-Man in film">Spider-Man in film</a> </div>
</caption>
<tbody><tr id="fileinfotpl&#95;desc">
<th scope="row">Description
</th>
<td>
<p>Collage of promotional photos of <a href="/wiki/Tobey_Maguire" title="Tobey Maguire">Tobey Maguire</a>, <a href="/wiki/Andrew_Garfield" title="Andrew Garfield">Andrew Garfield</a> and <a href="/wiki/Tom_Holland_(actor)" class="mw-redirect" title="Tom Holland (actor)">Tom Holland</a> in costume as <a href="/wiki/Spider-Man" title="Spider-Man">Spider-Man</a> in the live-action films.
</p>
</td></tr>

<tr>
<th scope="row" id="fileinfotpl&#95;src"><a href="/wiki/Template:Non-free_use_rationale#note-source" title="Template:Non-free use rationale">Source</a>
</th>
<td>
<p>This collage derives from three promotional stills owned by <a href="/wiki/Sony_Pictures" title="Sony Pictures">Sony Pictures</a> combined by the uploader.
</p>
</td></tr>


<tr>
<th scope="row"><a href="/wiki/Template:Non-free_use_rationale#note-article" title="Template:Non-free use rationale">Article</a>
</th>
<td>
<p><a href="/wiki/Spider-Man_in_film" title="Spider-Man in film">Spider-Man in film</a>
</p>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row" class="nowrap"><a href="/wiki/Template:Non-free_use_rationale#note-portion" title="Template:Non-free use rationale">Portion used</a>
</th>
<td>
<p>Three frames
</p>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row" class="nowrap"><a href="/wiki/Template:Non-free_use_rationale#note-resolution" title="Template:Non-free use rationale">Low resolution?</a>
</th>
<td>
<p>Yes
</p>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row" class="nowrap"><a href="/wiki/Template:Non-free_use_rationale#note-purpose" title="Template:Non-free use rationale">Purpose of use</a>
</th>
<td>
<p>To support encyclopedic discussion of associated works in the article. This illustration is specifically needed to give readers a visual presentation of the character's adaptation through the actors in the live-action films, which is discussed at length in the article.
</p>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row"><a href="/wiki/Template:Non-free_use_rationale#note-replace" title="Template:Non-free use rationale">Replaceable?</a>
</th>
<td>
<p>Any derivative work based upon the promotional stills would be a copyright violation, thus creation of a free image is impossible.
</p>
</td></tr>





<tr class="nfur-fairuse">
